        "Then fix the most visible data: hours, address, phone, services, identical on the site, the Google listing and the directories. One hour of work, an effect that lasts for years.",
        "Finally pick one frequent question and turn it into one clear page. Then another next month. Consistency beats the sprint. In a year, when your competitors get started, you will be twelve pages ahead with a history the machine already knows.",
